-- `local` sixteen lines below, which is legal Lua and silently wrong: this line wrote a global, the
-- later local shadowed it with nil, and `if SideCue then` never fired. Measured on the six section
-- renders, the active plate moved across rows 1..6 while the cue stayed at y 461..490 every time.
